how young and alive you feel?

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.720
Like, does that scare the 18-year-old you?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.980
Could you have ever imagined
being this fresh at 51?

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:33.813
- No.

00:15:33.813 --> 00:15:35.768
You know, when we were that
age, I was thinking like,

00:15:35.768 --> 00:15:37.150
51 was, you know.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.540
- I always tell the story.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.570
My cousin Bobby was in
my dad's liquor store

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:41.510
when I got there.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.477
He'd been there since he was 18.

00:15:42.477 --> 00:15:45.380
He was 30 when I was 22
and got there full time.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.410
I thought he was so fuckin' old.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:48.712
30 seemed like.

00:15:48.712 --> 00:15:49.900
That's why when I hang
out with the youngsters

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.080
that work for me, I'm like, "I get it."

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.320
Like, I always laugh.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.550
I'm like, man, I think John
and Jason and I are the same,

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.530
and they think I'm fuckin' like their dad.

00:15:58.530 --> 00:15:59.570
- Yeah.
- I'm like, no, no,

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:00.990
we're homies, like brothers.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:01.930
And they're like, no, dad.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.898
And I laugh about that because I'm 44.

00:16:04.898 --> 00:16:07.160
30 seemed old as fuck.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.400
Knowing, kinda your roots,
it must blow you away.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.190
- I've been in 35, since
the new year started,

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:14.038
I've been in 35 cities.

00:16:14.038 --> 00:16:15.150
- [Gary] That's amazing.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:17.000
- But half of them are fun.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:21.730
Golden Globes, McGregor
fight, Oscars, Super Bowl,

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:22.930
you know, whatever the case is.

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:24.580
Speaking and then hanging,
then taking my family

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.590
to the Bahamas and then
Cartagena for a wedding.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.423
It's great!

00:16:28.423 --> 00:16:29.256
- [Gary] Speed, speed.

00:16:29.256 --> 00:16:30.089
- It's great.

00:16:30.089 --> 00:16:30.922
It's great.

00:16:30.922 --> 00:16:31.755
And yeah, it does move slow.

